{"id": "ultratech-2026-06-16-018", "date": "2026-06-16", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q2", "month": 6, "week": 25, "weekday": "Tue"}, "entities": {"companies": ["ultratech"], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["raw_material_energy_cost"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "UltraTech deploys 45 electric trucks for clinker transport", "content": "<p><img src=\"https://www.globalcement.com/images/news/UltraTech-Cement-Manikgarh-cement-plant-1500.jpg\" /></p><p><strong>India: </strong>UltraTech Cement has announced the deployment of 45 electric heavy-duty trucks for clinker transportation in northern India. The fleet will transport clinker from UltraTech’s Kotputli plant in Rajasthan to its Dadri and Sikandarabad grinding plants in the Delhi-NCR region. The lead distance is approximately 250km, traversing Rajasthan, Haryana and Uttar Pradesh", "sources": [{"name": "global_cement", "url": "https://www.globalcement.com/news/20878-ultratech-deploys-45-electric-trucks-for-clinker-transport", "type": "rss"}]}
